       +0.25  nonlocal modified inertia, transparency w             -0.0132    -0.0281             2.00
       +0.50  nonlocal modified inertia, transparency w             -0.0413    -0.0562             2.61
       +0.75  nonlocal modified inertia, transparency w             -0.0694    -0.0843             3.21
       +1.00  modified gravity == local modified inertia            -0.0975    -0.1124             3.81

